<p><img src="/image/guoliang.jpg" align="right" width="120"  hspace="5" vspace="8" style="padding-left: 10px;padding-botton: 10px;">Discover the fascinating Guoliang Village, known as China's "cliff village" and a popular filming location. This remarkable settlement is famous for its incredible location perched on the cliff edge and its historic hand-carved tunnel road. The village showcases traditional architecture and offers stunning views of the surrounding mountains. The handmade road tunnel, built by local villagers, is considered one of China's most spectacular engineering feats.</p>
